RUF100 (delete_comment): deleting a noqa comment line after a line continuation joined the
continuation with the next line; delete from the backslash instead.
Regression test included; fuzz repro: repro/fix-ruf100-delete-comment-after-continuation.py (ruff_fix_validity).

diff --git a/crates/ruff_linter/resources/test/fixtures/ruff/RUF100_8.py b/crates/ruff_linter/resources/test/fixtures/ruff/RUF100_8.py
